    "basis": "A 35 mm corner bar with two perpendicular tall frames, three shared/upright posts, four diagonal braces, four original pottery groups and17 exposed fasteners. Independent90000/30000 triangles with1024/512 bakes preserve both frame openings and lower shelf rims; compare compact textures and inspect every head."
