  "reviewNotes": "PDF page9 and native full front/back plus isolated four sides of the shared corner post inspected. Source520024 triangles /26001284 bytes /height68.824898 mm. Datum17 mm; floor native[8.75,8.75] reaches25.520912 mm with normalZ.99999869 and maps to local[.75,.25]. West and south arms preserve the measured lower MT1-050 shelf layout and five counter caps; both native blockers converted with reversed Y. Source53 bevel planes refitted independently (maximum residual <.0005 mm); west/south pottery stay in front of those planes. Four braces fitted from cross sections: west(+/-.7660Y,.64285Z),south(+/-.7661X,.64276Z). Upper beam Y/X grain and continuous posts Z grain follow native timber. Inspect isolated corner carefully: only four corner heads are exposed (west upper, south lower/upper, north lower); the other putative heads are absent or enclosed by beam joints. Together with eight end-post heads and five counter caps there are17 exposed fasteners. Verify every metallic head, both frame apertures, lower shelf surfaces, standing placement, render/LOD/shadow and lighter texture candidate before publication. The initial256px LOD data map loses the exposed west upper corner head; raise LOD normal/ORM to512px (compact384) while preserving512px albedo and the independent30000-triangle mesh.",
